    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_sub">Local data and permission notice</string>
    <string name="about_mission_desc">To provide a simple, reliable, and secure dialer experience without compromising user privacy.</string>
    <string name="about_app_desc">Nova Dialer is a privacy-focused communication tool designed to put you in control of your data. Core dialer data is stored on your device; it leaves only when you call, text, export or share.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">At Nova Dialer, we prioritize your privacy.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_desc">Nova Dialer does not upload your contacts, call logs or recordings to a server. The app has no INTERNET permission.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_desc">Contacts, call history, the microphone (recording only), and optional SOS location are used only for the features you invoke. For quick replies and SOS alerts Nova Dialer hands a pre-filled message to your own messaging app; it does not send SMS by itself.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_desc">Nova Dialer does not sell or share data with third parties. Data leaves the device only when you call, text, export or share. Recordings you export or share are decrypted copies that other apps can open, and an exported backup is protected only by the password you set.</string>
    <string name="settings_support_desc" formatted="false">Nova Dialer is 100% free, open-source, ad-free, and privacy-first. If you find this app helpful, consider contributing code, submitting translations, or supporting the development of free and secure tools.</string>
    <string name="settings_contribute_github">Contribute on GitHub</string>

